  "question": {
    "text": "If $y=f(x)$ makes $+v e$ intercept of 2 and 0 unit on $x$ and $y$ axes and encloses an area of $3 / 4$ square unit with the axes then $\\int_0^2 x f^{\\prime}(x) d x ~~is$",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
